      ":question/id": "3929629c-556e-5250-acf5-f5521bddbe07",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos\\left(x-\\pi\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the difference formula:\n\n$$\n\\cos(u-v)=\\cos u\\cos v+\\sin u\\sin v\n$$\n\nWith $u=x$ and $v=\\pi$, the exact values are $\\cos(\\pi)=-1$ and $\\sin(\\pi)=0$. Substitute and collect the terms in the requested order:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos\\left(x-\\pi\\right)&=\\cos x\\cos\\left(\\pi\\right)+\\sin x\\sin\\left(\\pi\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+\\sin x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\cos x.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
